851
00:31:12.435 --> 00:31:13.884
I couldn't even,

852
00:31:13.884 --> 00:31:15.917
my brain would signal to that muscle group

853
00:31:15.917 --> 00:31:17.422
and it wouldn't do anything.

854
00:31:17.422 --> 00:31:19.548
Like that's how bad that situation was.

855
00:31:19.548 --> 00:31:22.503
And now I can kind of do these little exercises

856
00:31:22.503 --> 00:31:23.641
that are annoying.

857
00:31:23.641 --> 00:31:24.811
And as somebody who's like,

