00:31:37.884 --> 00:31:39.672
like on video is like, okay, well,

864
00:31:39.672 --> 00:31:41.866
if Peter's prioritizing this,

865
00:31:41.866 --> 00:31:43.707
like I realize this is important.

866
00:31:43.707 --> 00:31:45.728
And it's given me like permission

867
00:31:45.728 --> 00:31:47.540
to really kind of embrace this,

868
00:31:47.540 --> 00:31:49.329
but it's been interesting.

869
00:31:49.329 --> 00:31:51.728
And I realize like how,

870
00:31:51.728 --> 00:31:53.761
how kind of much work remains

871
00:31:53.761 --> 00:31:56.814
in order for me to really be stable.

872
00:31:56.814 --> 00:31:58.314
Look, it took me

