00:31:59.710 --> 00:32:02.710
probably three years of backing off,

874
00:32:03.728 --> 00:32:05.811
to then go forward again.

875
00:32:07.621 --> 00:32:09.498
So in about late 2018,

876
00:32:09.498 --> 00:32:12.331
mid 2018 was when I really decided

877
00:32:13.465 --> 00:32:18.465
I was a hundred percent all in on my Centenarian decathlon,

878
00:32:18.637 --> 00:32:20.467
not just sort of in name,

879
00:32:20.467 --> 00:32:21.829
but the sort of the ethos of this thing,

880
00:32:21.829 --> 00:32:24.086
which is I am no longer making any concessions,

881
00:32:24.086 --> 00:32:26.861
'cause one of the dirty little secrets is,

