trained practitioners who can teach this,

1313
00:49:12.806 --> 00:49:14.222
but are there YouTube videos?

1314
00:49:14.222 --> 00:49:16.075
Like if somebody's listening to this,

1315
00:49:16.075 --> 00:49:18.606
how should they go about researching this or finding?

1316
00:49:18.606 --> 00:49:20.379
So, I did a podcast with one

1317
00:49:20.379 --> 00:49:23.973
