What's her name?

1343
00:50:20.477 --> 00:50:21.310
Beth Lewis.

1344
00:50:21.310 --> 00:50:22.143
Yeah, Beth Lewis,

1345
00:50:22.143 --> 00:50:24.613
who's kind of taking you through some more type of,

1346
00:50:24.613 --> 00:50:29.249
kind of movement activation type of exercises.

1347
00:50:29.249 --> 00:50:30.082
I don't think there's anybody

1348
00:50:30.082 --> 00:50:31.991
who's not gonna benefit from DNS,

1349
00:50:31.991 --> 00:50:32.844
but I also acknowledge

1350
00:50:32.844 --> 00:50:34.339
that I don't think it fixes every problem.

1351
00:50:34.339 --> 00:50:36.285
So there's a whole other system called PRI,

1352
00:50:36.285 --> 00:50:39.048
Postural Restoration Institute,

1353
00:50:39.048 --> 00:50:43.361
which is amazing at fixing another huge problem,

1354
00:50:43.361 --> 00:50:46.258
which is when that pelvic tilts forward, the ribs flare up,

1355
