1750
01:06:45.438 --> 01:06:48.320
you're an inactive person versus you're in the top 2.5%,

1751
01:06:48.320 --> 01:06:50.330
which isn't otherworldly by the way,

1752
01:06:50.330 --> 01:06:52.588
like you and I are probably in the top 2.5%

1753
01:06:52.588 --> 01:06:54.857
for our age group.

