Right, and if you're going from completely sedentary.

1763
01:07:14.396 --> 01:07:15.645
You can get there.
Yeah.

1764
01:07:15.645 --> 01:07:16.965
Very quickly.
Yes.

1765
01:07:16.965 --> 01:07:19.671
It's interesting how the human,

1766
01:07:19.671 --> 01:07:20.981
animal is wired though.

1767
01:07:20.981 --> 01:07:22.548
It's like, ooh, you know,

1768
