Sure, yeah.

1795
01:08:15.276 --> 01:08:17.296
So rapamycin is a compound

1796
01:08:17.296 --> 01:08:19.467
that was actually discovered remarkably

1797
01:08:19.467 --> 01:08:22.855
serendipitously on Easter Island in the 1960s.

1798
01:08:22.855 --> 01:08:24.505
They didn't know what they had at the time.

1799
01:08:24.505 --> 01:08:26.754
And it was sort of purified from the bacteria

1800
01:08:26.754 --> 01:08:29.881
that were found in the soil there in the 1970s

1801
01:08:29.881 --> 01:08:31.542
and ultimately produced a drug

1802
01:08:31.542 --> 01:08:33.080
that was a potent immunosuppressant.

1803
01:08:33.080 --> 01:08:36.017
So it suppressed the proliferation of T cells.

1804
01:08:36.017 --> 01:08:39.411
And in the late nineties was approved by the FDA for use

1805
01:08:39.411 --> 01:08:41.484
in patients with organ transplants.

1806
01:08:41.484 --> 01:08:43.744
But a decade later, another discovery was made,

1807
01:08:43.744 --> 01:08:45.271
which was actually, if you dosed it a bit,

1808
01:08:45.271 --> 01:08:48.535
a little differently, it was a very potent longevity agent.

1809
01:08:48.535 --> 01:08:51.450
So potent in fact that it did something no drug or molecule

1810
01:08:51.450 --> 01:08:53.961
had ever done before or has ever done since,

1811
01:08:53.961 --> 01:08:57.217
which is it extends life in every organism

1812
01:08:57.217 --> 01:08:59.448
across the entire spectrum of eukaryotic models.

1813
01:08:59.448 --> 01:09:02.259
So yeast, worms, fruit flies, mice.

1814
01:09:02.259 --> 01:09:05.027
We now see it in even other organisms.

1815
01:09:05.027 --> 01:09:08.174
And again, it does so without contradiction.

1816
01:09:08.174 --> 01:09:11.438
So we just see this over and over and over again.

1817
01:09:11.438 --> 01:09:14.461
And that's a very rare feature in science.

1818
01:09:14.461 --> 01:09:17.363
And it's been around for many years, decades.

1819
01:09:17.363 --> 01:09:18.217
20 Plus years.

1820
01:09:18.217 --> 01:09:20.369
So there is some data sets

1821
01:09:20.369 --> 01:09:22.782
on the impact of human life

1822
01:09:22.782 --> 01:09:24.919
over time in the context of organ transplant,

1823
01:09:24.919 --> 01:09:28.422
