01:16:03.881 --> 01:16:06.705
So in the ,gosh, 1980s, maybe even early nineties,

1987
01:16:06.705 --> 01:16:09.764
a very, very famous and amazing endocrinologist

1988
01:16:09.764 --> 01:16:11.804
