1997
01:16:32.722 --> 01:16:36.639
this thing tends to cluster around all diseases

1998
01:16:38.059 --> 01:16:40.626
that are kind of metabolic in origin,

1999
01:16:40.626 --> 01:16:41.510
cardiovascular disease,

2000
01:16:41.510 --> 01:16:44.209
cancer, neurodegenerative disease, diabetes, fatty liver,

2001
01:16:44.209 --> 01:16:46.440
although we didn't know about fatty liver at the time,

2002
01:16:46.440 --> 01:16:50.573
all of these things tend to cluster around this thing,

2003
01:16:50.573 --> 01:16:52.323
he called syndrome X.

2004
01:16:54.061 --> 01:16:56.530
And without going through the details of how that migrated,

2005
01:16:56.530 --> 01:17:00.298
what we now know is he was referring to insulin resistance

2006
01:17:00.298 --> 01:17:02.202
