2010
01:17:09.030 --> 01:17:12.094
So it's basically defined by how big your waste is,

2011
01:17:12.094 --> 01:17:15.973
how high your blood pressure is, how high your glucose is,

2012
01:17:15.973 --> 01:17:17.364
