2013
01:17:17.364 --> 01:17:21.154
and how low your HDL cholesterol is.

2014
01:17:21.154 --> 01:17:22.731
And there's sort of a line drawn in the sand

2015
01:17:22.731 --> 01:17:26.397
that says if three, four or five of those metrics

2016
01:17:26.397 --> 01:17:27.893
are beyond a threshold,

2017
01:17:27.893 --> 01:17:30.065
you have met syn, you have metabolic syndrome.

2018
01:17:30.065 --> 01:17:32.302
And of course it's a continuum.

2019
01:17:32.302 --> 01:17:33.847
So I used to know the stats very well.

