2021
01:17:35.844 --> 01:17:38.163
which would be, very bad, four outta five,

2022
01:17:38.163 --> 01:17:39.481
and what fraction of the population

2023
01:17:39.481 --> 01:17:41.471
had like zero out of five.

2024
01:17:41.471 --> 01:17:43.084
And so if you lined up everybody

2025
01:17:43.084 --> 01:17:44.625
